    },
    {
      "key": "barge_1",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "Barjele (Barki) au transportat cărbune și nisip pe Odra timp de secole.",
      "sourceEnText": "Barges (Barki) have carried coal and sand on the Odra for centuries.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "cristi",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4937,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:34:46Z",
      "textHash": "f1184402e0c6d630ec342778861dc1cc30fa21a91b224f1a4e30bdf43310b7eb"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "O barjă este foarte plată. De ce?",
      "sourceEnText": "A barge is very flat. Why?",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "cristi",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4284,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:34:47Z",
      "textHash": "d8c797bad22d77dbecc84d86a0667e558d296fe9da38d54150ac5bc91f88d63c"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "A căra lucruri grele chiar și atunci când apa nu este adâncă.",
      "sourceEnText": "To carry heavy things even when the water is not deep.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "cristi",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:34:49Z",
      "textHash": "c44fb605aad6ad116c5d8361f39940ef779274cc2481880501780e297e0c290a"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "Exact! E un camion care plutește.",
      "sourceEnText": "Exactly! It's a truck that floats.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "cristi",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:34:50Z",
      "textHash": "f3db500a0205eb76a17477a603215321924e112e90cb6d6eee81fa936b590a14"
    },
    {
      "key": "barge_5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_barge",
      "sourceText": "Deci se poate ascunde de pitici",
      "sourceEnText": "So it can hide from dwarves",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_barge_5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "cristi",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:34:52Z",
      "textHash": "acdb5a6ae90131f77ddc697246996dc990aaf536d816f9f98b0950de98c62a37"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_house1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Repară ferestrele la casa plutitoare!",
      "sourceEnText": "Fix the windows on the floating house!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_house1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "cristi",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:34:32Z",
      "textHash": "6a555752ae6b4874b318d2327df1b82df578f40f170059a52a94cc27fd5811c6"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_house2",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "O casă confortabilă pe râul Oder! Fotografie colectată.",
      "sourceEnText": "A cozy home on the Odra! Photo collected.",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_house2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "cristi",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3814,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:34:33Z",
      "textHash": "26ebd8e692d07f5288dddc28d8c4cd91cfddb0b7cd2a79e0f5bc854a79bf2cff"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_map1",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "Dovedește că știi pe unde curge râul!",
      "sourceEnText": "Prove you know where the river flows!",
      "audioFile": "pl_03_ch_map1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "cristi",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2247,
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-04T17:32:56Z",
      "textHash": "61acd0fc13fe97b881646d09d27a68fa60a3bf2cdc8498b03988a6e27bd0c464"
    },
    {
      "key": "ch_map2",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_odra_map",
      "sourceText": "Harta a revenit! Arată cum Odra se varsă în Marea Baltică.",
      "sourceEnText": "The map is back! It shows the Odra flowing into the Baltic Sea.",
